{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey",
    "steam_appid": 3447910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey</i> is an arcade motorbike racing game that lets you take part in an individual fight for the championship in the top league of a speedway competition. Compete over multiple career seasons and prove that you are the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Speedway Odyssey</i> players will see their avatar from a top-down view in a 2D setting on a set of varied round and oval tracks. Each track features a unique combination of static fast (or slow) lanes and a distinct shape providing players with a diverse experience. Your competition for each new game start will be a group of randomly generated AI players of varied difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows for up to 4 players to play locally on a single computer. All game modes (single race, single tournament and career) can be played locally, requiring either a keyboard that supports multiple simultaneous key presses or additional controllers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speedway Odyssey players are given the option to set the number of seasons the career will span, ranging from 1 to 20 seasons. At the start of each career, historical rankings are randomly generated, allowing players to ascend a new set each time. Alternatively, with a switch in options, rankings may start empty.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your title and don't let other pretenders take it away from you. Show that you are the true legend of speedway!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey</i> is an arcade motorbike racing game that lets you take part in an individual fight for the championship in the top league of a speedway competition. Compete over multiple career seasons and prove that you are the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Speedway Odyssey</i> players will see their avatar from a top-down view in a 2D setting on a set of varied round and oval tracks. Each track features a unique combination of static fast (or slow) lanes and a distinct shape providing players with a diverse experience. Your competition for each new game start will be a group of randomly generated AI players of varied difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows for up to 4 players to play locally on a single computer. All game modes (single race, single tournament and career) can be played locally, requiring either a keyboard that supports multiple simultaneous key presses or additional controllers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speedway Odyssey players are given the option to set the number of seasons the career will span, ranging from 1 to 20 seasons. At the start of each career, historical rankings are randomly generated, allowing players to ascend a new set each time. Alternatively, with a switch in options, rankings may start empty.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your title and don't let other pretenders take it away from you. Show that you are the true legend of speedway!</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the world of speedway racing. Speedway Odyssey offers you a chance to compete in the battle for championship at the top tier of a speedway competition. Can you earn the title of champion? And if you do, can you defend it?",
